    "authored-fixture-lesson 4: isolated vertices and disconnected paths never affect the witness; remove them before touching cycle vertices.",
    "authored-fixture-lesson 5: deletions that shorten the odd cycle to an even length destroy the witness; prefer tree deletions.",
    "authored-fixture-lesson 6: check every candidate against the exact oracle; count every query including failures."
